{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2019-10-29 22:30:00', 'title': 'MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 16, 2019', 'text': 'MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL ANNOUNCED THAT ON OCTOBER 30, 2019 ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.13 PER SHARE TOTALING APPROXIMATELY $67 MILLION. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 16, 2019 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON DECEMBER 10, 2019.'}